\newlabel{fig:atomic-replan}{{6}{8}{One transaction on the shared lane. (a) Admission reserves one all-fail recovery per TB and rejects TB5; the 45~ms batch deletes two debts in one generation. (b) The verifier commits the 128-token AI lease and keeps $X_t$ for the 256-token AI lease, whose last recovery would end after the guard. AI units are Qwen prefill requests; hatching marks the 5~ms launch-control charge}{figure.caption.12}{}}
